		{
			dependencies: ["4B8F2D6A93E7C051"]
			hide_until_deps_complete: true
			description: ["Stand inside any ruin, house, tower or city block out past the border. Most barrels and cupboards out there are ordinary scavenging: food, timber, scrap metal. The &6gold-trimmed&r chests and barrels are the real stashes. Each one rolls its own loot for every player, always carries a bonus on top, and that bonus scales with distance from the base, so the further you go the better the haul, and the longer the pedestal stands on its own. They turn grey once you've looted yours. The stashes in the ruins and towns are guarded: a spawner nearby keeps sending the dead, day or night, and they get nastier the further out you are. Break it with a pickaxe to shut it off. Guards drop no loot bags - the stash is the prize."]
			icon: "minecraft:cracked_stone_bricks"
			id: "4F1477C0746CED34"
