		{
			dependencies: ["0CBAE9737A4869E9"]
			hide_until_deps_complete: true
			description: ["The pedestal can be made tougher, and you pay in &eXP levels&r. Right-click the pedestal with an empty hand to open its upgrade screen (&e/pedestal&r, or &a[Upgrades]&r in chat after a wave clears, opens it too). Three upgrades, three tiers each: &eMax HP&r (300 up to 600), &eArmor&r (up to 45% less damage) and &eThorns&r (up to 3 damage a second back at everything hitting it). Tiers cost 5, 10 and 15 levels. Upgrades belong to the pedestal, so anyone can chip in."]
			icon: "minecraft:experience_bottle"
			id: "2E93FD4CE7F6AE87"
