			description: ["A &eBackpack&r takes four leather, four string and a chest. Leather and string both turn up in Uncommon loot bags and scavenged containers. Press &eB&r to open it while it's in your inventory or worn on your back. Ring it with copper, then iron, gold and diamond ingots to upgrade it, and it keeps everything inside."]
